00:00:03.677 --> 00:00:08.355
The fundamental responsibility of the
general manager is to create a strategy,

00:00:08.355 --> 00:00:13.640
a way his or her organization is going to
achieve success competing in the world.

00:00:13.640 --> 00:00:17.186
And then to build your organization
through which that strategy can be

00:00:17.186 --> 00:00:17.794
realized.

00:00:17.794 --> 00:00:21.616
&gt;&gt; What they need to do is have a set of
skills for diagnosing the challenges that

00:00:21.616 --> 00:00:25.758
they're tackling and also then being able
to translate that into an action plan.

00:00:25.758 --> 00:00:32.019
[MUSIC]

